# Section 2 — Operational Reliability

## OR-01 Single Source of Truth

Verify that each operational state has only one authoritative owner.

Examples:

- Active Match
- Active Queue
- Timer
- Score
- Winner
- Match Status

Status:

☐ PASS ☐ PARTIAL ☐ FAIL

---

## OR-02 Ownership Protection

Review whether inactive modules are prevented from overwriting the active competition state.

Examples:

- Event Host cannot overwrite Manual Queue ownership.
- Manual Queue cannot overwrite Event Host without operator action.

Status:

☐ PASS ☐ PARTIAL ☐ FAIL

---

## OR-03 Predictable State Transitions

Review every ownership transition.

Transitions should always be explicit, deterministic, and recoverable.

Status:

☐ PASS ☐ PARTIAL ☐ FAIL

---

## OR-04 Recovery After Failure

Review recovery behavior after:

- application restart
- Event Host disconnect
